Simple Transfer to Linux

  On Your Linux Box

  # Clone your repo
  git clone ssh://git@codeberg.org/gregburd/osv.git
  cd osv

  # Checkout the claude branch
  git checkout claude

  # Push to remote
  git push origin claude

  # Initialize submodule
  git submodule update --init --recursive

  That's it! The branch is now on your remote and you can start building.

