  ⚡ Quick Start on Linux

  # After cloning and checking out claude branch:

  # 1. Install dependencies
  sudo ./scripts/setup.py

  # 2. Build OSv with ZFS
  ./scripts/build arch=aarch64 fs=zfs image=native-example

  # 3. Test
  ./scripts/run.py

  # 4. Inside OSv, test ZFS
  /# zpool status
  /# zfs lsudo ./scripts/setup.py

